     * [Prerendering](https://wasp.sh/docs/advanced/prerendering).
     *
     * @default false
     *
     * @example
     * ```ts
     * import { app, page, route } from "@wasp.sh/spec"
     * import { SomePage } from "./src/SomePage" with { type: "ref" }
     *
     * export default app({
     *   // ...
     *   spec: [
     *     route("NameRoute", "/some-path", page(SomePage), {
     *       prerender: true,
     *     }),
     *   ],
     * })
     * ```
